    "headline": "First Solar Shares Jump After Trump Introduces New Tariffs on Solar Imports",
    "summary": "First Solar (NASDAQ:FSLR) shares climbed around 8% in premarket trading after US President Donald Trump signed an executive order introducing a 15% tariff alongside minimum import price requirements for polysilicon and its downstream products. The measures, implemented under Section 232 of the Trade Expansion Act, will take effect on 4 December 2026.",
